N        EQU   16
KEY      EQU   1000
K        EQU   1200
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT1  1           B1. Initialize. l ← 1.
         ENT2  N           u ← N.
         JMP   2F          To B2.
5H       JE    SUCCESS     Jump if K = Ki.
         ENT1  1,3         B5. Adjust l. l ← i + 1.
2H       ENTA  0,1         B2. Get midpoint.
         INCA  0,2         rA ← l + u.
         SRB   1           rA ← ⌊rA/2⌋. (rX changes too.)
         STA   TEMP
         CMP1  TEMP
         JG    FAILURE     Jump if u < l.
         LD3   TEMP        i ← midpoint.
3H       LDA   K           B3. Compare.
         CMPA  KEY,3
         JGE   5B          Jump if K ≥ Ki.
         ENT2  -1,3        B4. Adjust u. u ← i − 1.
         JMP   2B          To B2.
FAILURE  ENTA  0
         HLT
SUCCESS  ENTA  0,3
         HLT
TEMP     CON   0
         END   START
